{
  "schema": "remora-cumulative-limits/v1",
  "comment": "Reference cumulative-limits policy for the OT setpoint pilot (UNSIGNED). REMORA verifies a SIGNED envelope (remora-cumulative-limits-signed/v1): sign this with the authority Ed25519 key via REMORA's scripts/sign_limit_policy.py, publish only the public key in REMORA_LIMITS_TRUSTED_KEYS, and set REMORA_REQUIRE_LIMITS=1 to enforce. Movement is observed from the twin (ot_registry.observe_limit_value), not from what REMORA last allowed.",
